### ==============================================================================
### EasyAudit - Roteiro de Testes Ponta a Ponta Local (Walkthrough E2E)
### ==============================================================================
### Este arquivo reproduz o fluxo completo do MVP contra o ambiente local:
### Docker Compose (Keycloak, Postgres, RabbitMQ) + Aplicação EasyAudit.
###
### Compatível com a extensão REST Client (VS Code) e HTTP Client (IntelliJ).
### Cada requisição documenta também o comando equivalente em `curl`.
### ==============================================================================

@host = http://localhost:8080
@keycloak = http://localhost:8081
@realm = easyaudit
@clientId = easyaudit-api

###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Obter Token de PLATFORM_ADMIN (Keycloak)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginPlatformAdmin
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&grant_type=password&username=admin.plataforma&password=senha123

@platformToken = {{loginPlatformAdmin.response.body.access_token}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Onboarding do Tenant (PLATFORM_ADMIN)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createTenant
POST {{host}}/admin/v1/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{platformToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lojista E2E Alpha",
  "slug": "lojista-e2e-alpha",
  "cnpjs": ["45.723.174/0001-10"]
}

@tenantId = {{createTenant.response.body.id}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Login Admin do Keycloak para vincular o tenantId aos usuários de teste
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginKeycloakMasterAdmin
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/master/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=admin-cli&grant_type=password&username=admin&password=admin

@kcAdminToken = {{loginKeycloakMasterAdmin.response.body.access_token}}


###
### 3.1 Localizar Usuário admin.a no Keycloak
###
# @name getAdminA
GET {{keycloak}}/admin/realms/{{realm}}/users?username=admin.a
Authorization: Bearer {{kcAdminToken}}

@adminAId = {{getAdminA.response.body.$[0].id}}

###
### 3.2 Atualizar atributo tenant_id do admin.a
###
PUT {{keycloak}}/admin/realms/{{realm}}/users/{{adminAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{kcAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin.a",
  "email": "admin.a@example.com",
  "enabled": true,
  "attributes": {
    "tenant_id": ["{{tenantId}}"]
  }
}


###
### 3.3 Localizar Usuário auditor.a no Keycloak
###
# @name getAuditorA
GET {{keycloak}}/admin/realms/{{realm}}/users?username=auditor.a
Authorization: Bearer {{kcAdminToken}}

@auditorAId = {{getAuditorA.response.body.$[0].id}}

###
### 3.4 Atualizar atributo tenant_id do auditor.a
###
PUT {{keycloak}}/admin/realms/{{realm}}/users/{{auditorAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{kcAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "auditor.a",
  "email": "auditor.a@example.com",
  "enabled": true,
  "attributes": {
    "tenant_id": ["{{tenantId}}"]
  }
}


###
### 3.5 Localizar Usuário financeiro.a no Keycloak
###
# @name getFinanceiroA
GET {{keycloak}}/admin/realms/{{realm}}/users?username=financeiro.a
Authorization: Bearer {{kcAdminToken}}

@financeiroAId = {{getFinanceiroA.response.body.$[0].id}}

###
### 3.6 Atualizar atributo tenant_id do financeiro.a
###
PUT {{keycloak}}/admin/realms/{{realm}}/users/{{financeiroAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{kcAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "financeiro.a",
  "email": "financeiro.a@example.com",
  "enabled": true,
  "attributes": {
    "tenant_id": ["{{tenantId}}"]
  }
}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Obtenção de Tokens JWT dos Papéis do Tenant
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Token TENANT_ADMIN (admin.a)
# @name loginTenantAdmin
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&grant_type=password&username=admin.a&password=senha123

@tenantAdminToken = {{loginTenantAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### 4.2 Token AUDITOR (auditor.a)
# @name loginAuditor
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&grant_type=password&username=auditor.a&password=senha123

@auditorToken = {{loginAuditor.response.body.access_token}}

### 4.3 Token FINANCE (financeiro.a)
# @name loginFinance
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id={{clientId}}&grant_type=password&username=financeiro.a&password=senha123

@financeToken = {{loginFinance.response.body.access_token}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Criação de Credencial de Integração (Webhooks HMAC) - TENANT_ADMIN
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createCredential
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tenant/integration-credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Credencial Webhooks E2E Walkthrough"
}

@keyId = {{createCredential.response.body.keyId}}
@secret = {{createCredential.response.body.secret}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Cadastro da Transportadora (TENANT_ADMIN)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createCarrier
POST {{host}}/api/v1/carriers
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cnpj": "11222333000181",
  "name": "Transportadora Rápidos E2E"
}

@carrierId = {{createCarrier.response.body.id}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Cadastro da Tabela de Frete (TENANT_ADMIN)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createFreightTable
POST {{host}}/api/v1/freight-tables
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carrierId": "{{carrierId}}",
  "content": {
    "name": "Tabela T",
    "validFrom": "2026-01-01",
    "includesIcms": false,
    "cubingFactor": 300,
    "minimumFreight": 40.00,
    "dispatchFee": 5.00,
    "routes": [
      {
        "name": "SP capital",
        "destinationCepFrom": "01000000",
        "destinationCepTo": "09999999",
        "weightBands": [
          { "fromKg": 0, "toKg": 5, "price": 20.00 },
          { "fromKg": 5, "toKg": 10, "price": 28.00 },
          { "fromKg": 10, "toKg": 30, "price": 45.00 }
        ],
        "excessPerKg": 1.20,
        "adValoremPercent": 0.30,
        "adValoremMinimum": 2.00,
        "grisPercent": 0.20,
        "grisMinimum": 1.50,
        "tollPer100Kg": 3.10
      }
    ],
    "specialAreas": []
  }
}

@tableId = {{createFreightTable.response.body.id}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Ativação da Tabela de Frete (TENANT_ADMIN)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name activateFreightTable
POST {{host}}/api/v1/freight-tables/{{tableId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. Ingestão de NF-e e CT-e via Webhook HMAC
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### OBS: Em clientes HTTP com suporte a HMAC/scripts prévios, os cabeçalhos são gerados
### dinamicamente. Alternativamente, use o script `docs/local-walkthrough.sh`.
### Os valores abaixo usam os arquivos assinados de `docs/fixtures/`.
###
### curl exemplo:
### TS=$(date +%s)
### BODY='{"documents":[{"name":"nfe.xml","contentBase64":"..."},{"name":"cte.xml","contentBase64":"..."}]}'
### SIG=$(printf '%s.%s' "$TS" "$BODY" | openssl dgst -sha256 -hmac "$SECRET" -hex | sed 's/^.* //')
### curl -s -X POST "$HOST/webhooks/v1/documents" \
###   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
###   -H "X-EasyAudit-Key-Id: $KEY_ID" \
###   -H "X-EasyAudit-Timestamp: $TS" \
###   -H "X-EasyAudit-Signature: sha256=$SIG" \
###   -d "$BODY"
###

# @name ingestDocuments
POST {{host}}/webhooks/v1/documents
Content-Type: application/json
X-EasyAudit-Key-Id: {{keyId}}
X-EasyAudit-Timestamp: 1760440000
X-EasyAudit-Signature: sha256=COLOQUE_A_ASSINATURA_HMAC_SE_RODAR_MANUALMENTE

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "name": "nfe.xml",
      "contentBase64": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "cte.xml",
      "contentBase64": ""
    }
  ]
}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. Ingestão da Cotação via Webhook HMAC
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### curl exemplo:
### TS=$(date +%s)
### BODY='{"source":"INTELIPOST","externalId":"Q-9501","carrierCnpj":"11222333000181","service":"Rodoviário","amount":66.02,"quotedAt":"2026-10-09T10:00:00-03:00","destinationCep":"01310100","weightKg":12.5,"cargoValue":1000,"deliveryDays":5,"nfeKey":"35261045723174000110550010000095011876543210"}'
### SIG=$(printf '%s.%s' "$TS" "$BODY" | openssl dgst -sha256 -hmac "$SECRET" -hex | sed 's/^.* //')
### curl -s -X POST "$HOST/webhooks/v1/quotes" \
###   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
###   -H "X-EasyAudit-Key-Id: $KEY_ID" \
###   -H "X-EasyAudit-Timestamp: $TS" \
###   -H "X-EasyAudit-Signature: sha256=$SIG" \
###   -d "$BODY"
###

# @name ingestQuote
POST {{host}}/webhooks/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json
X-EasyAudit-Key-Id: {{keyId}}
X-EasyAudit-Timestamp: 1760440000
X-EasyAudit-Signature: sha256=COLOQUE_A_ASSINATURA_HMAC_SE_RODAR_MANUALMENTE

{
  "source": "INTELIPOST",
  "externalId": "Q-9501",
  "carrierCnpj": "11222333000181",
  "service": "Rodoviário",
  "amount": 66.02,
  "quotedAt": "2026-10-09T10:00:00-03:00",
  "destinationCep": "01310100",
  "weightKg": 12.5,
  "cargoValue": 1000,
  "deliveryDays": 5,
  "nfeKey": "35261045723174000110550010000095011876543210"
}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. Listagem de Casos de Auditoria (AUDITOR)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### O processamento é assíncrono via RabbitMQ. Aguarde alguns instantes até o status
### do caso passar a DIVERGENT (cobrado 80.00, calculado 66.02, divergência 13.98).
###
# @name listAudits
GET {{host}}/api/v1/audits
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}

@caseId = {{listAudits.response.body.items[0].id}}
@caseVersion = {{listAudits.response.body.items[0].version}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. Detalhe do Caso de Auditoria (AUDITOR)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/audits/{{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 13. Abertura de Contestação (AUDITOR)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name disputeAudit
POST {{host}}/api/v1/audits/{{caseId}}/dispute
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": {{caseVersion}},
  "category": "VALUE_ABOVE_REFERENCE",
  "description": "Frete cobrado acima da tabela negociada",
  "amountDue": 66.02
}

@resolvedVersion = {{disputeAudit.response.body.version}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 14. Resolução da Contestação com Aprovação em R$ 66,02 (AUDITOR)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name resolveAudit
POST {{host}}/api/v1/audits/{{caseId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": {{resolvedVersion}},
  "agreedAmount": 66.02,
  "note": "Transportadora aceitou o valor de tabela"
}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 15. Criação de Lote de Pagamento (FINANCE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createPaymentBatch
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payment-batches
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dueDate": "2026-11-10",
  "description": "Lote E2E Novembro",
  "caseIds": ["{{caseId}}"]
}

@batchId = {{createPaymentBatch.response.body.batch.id}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 16. Exportação do Lote em CSV com BOM UTF-8 e ';' (FINANCE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payment-batches/{{batchId}}/export
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 17. Baixa Manual do Lote de Pagamento (FINANCE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payment-batches/{{batchId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{financeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paidOn": "2026-10-10",
  "reference": "TED-E2E-20261010-001"
}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 18. Indicadores Consolidados do Dashboard (AUDITOR)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}


###
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 19. Ranking de Transportadoras no Dashboard (AUDITOR)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dashboard/carriers?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}

